stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Bound
    Bound --> Retired: herdr restart / proved RootReplaced
    Retired --> FreshLaunch: first input / no journal
    Retired --> EndedJournal: restored unfinished_handoff ended=true
    EndedJournal --> Launch: retry deadline reached / exact claim
    Launch --> Backoff: launch failed / persist failures + deadline
    Backoff --> Launch: 2,4,8,16 seconds / row removed AND token released
    Launch --> Retained: fifth launch failure / atomic original + notice intent
    Retained --> NextHead: clear journal / revoke claim
    FreshLaunch --> Submitted: reserve consumes original once
    Launch --> Submitted: reserve consumes ended journal once
    Submitted --> [*]
    NextHead --> [*]: deduplicated visible failure notice
    EndedJournal --> Cancelled: Cancel original or clear waiting
    Backoff --> Cancelled: Cancel original or clear waiting
    Cancelled --> [*]
